WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Cammy’s jumping medium punch meets the airborne Ryu.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.000
Cammy cancels the air medium into Level 2.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Raw Rush reaches the airborne opponent for crouching heavy.

4
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.050
The back-heavy juggle cancels into another Rush.

5
00:00:07.050 --> 00:00:10.500
Cammy spends her remaining Super stock after light Arrow.

6
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.950
The extended air conversion ends in knockdown.
